gories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"itAhmbhHOyQQparfwicjDQ","review_id":"i3CdP9aQzs1osH06wf8HjA","date":"2021-10-25T02:33:30","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9304906129837036,"text_excerpt":"I came to Mammoth Espresso on the recommendation of a friend of mine who is a coffee connoisseur; furthermore, I really enjoyed my experience here. Mammoth Espresso sits right in the heart of the Warehouse District of New Orleans in a minimalistic yet adorable space; I was a big fan of the pink furniture that sits outside. Service was fast and friendly, and my iced lavender latte really hit the spot and got me together for the long day of exploring around NOLA that I had ahead of me. The next time I find myself in NOLA I will definitely come back to Mammoth Espresso to get my caffeine fix and try more of their coffee. PS: They sell some cute merch inside. I was able to grab some stickers ..."},{"business_id":"itAhmbhHOyQQparfwicjDQ","review_id":"6sCmBdrMJX6-QRxVcgzYgQ","date":"2020-01-17T18:22:04","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9180760383605957,"text_excerpt":"Tasty caffeine jitters. Was in town for just a few days, and needed two things: a place to sit and work, and lots of strong, delicious coffee. Walking over to Mammoth was a good choice. Had the Sweet Little Thing, some pour over, a cinnamon roll...by the time I got to my third coffee the barista looked concerned for my health. But man, everything was prepared expertly. Most of the time, I'm gonna go for dark, clean, unadulterated coffee - but I do appreciate inventive concoctions, too. Fortunately, you'll find both here. Next time I'll check out their espresso tonic. Space is cozy, with just enough room to socialize with a couple friends, or hide in a corner and do your own thing. The til..."},{"business_id":"itAhmbhHOyQQparfwicjDQ","review_id":"miCwf6cYVmAf8QD362C6pg","date":"2019-08-10T20:59:22","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9147602915763855,"text_excerpt":"So far, Mammoth served me my favorite espresso I've gotten in New Orleans! My fiancé and I are big coffee nerds so chatting to Jonathan, our barista that day, felt like a breath of fresh air. It was nice to have a good connection, great service, and exceptional coffee. In just talking to him, it is evident he knows, cares, and loves what he serves. He takes great care of the product and knows what he is doing. If you know and love coffee, you will not be let down. We will definitely be back!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"itAhmbhHOyQQparfwicjDQ","photo_id":"l0TExH9f6QYVGOxcKRq_2A","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/l0TExH9f6QYVGOxcKRq_2A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9186030030250549},{"business_id":"itAhmbhHOyQQparfwicjDQ","photo_id":"F8Lr56eW93fcOr7IZtTv4g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/F8Lr56eW93fcOr7IZtTv4g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9056932330131531},{"business_id":"itAhmbhHOyQQparfwicjDQ","photo_id":"lYqec34TTURz0sHjyDxfrg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/lYqec34TTURz0sHjyDxfrg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9025297164916992},{"business_id":"itAhmbhHOyQQparfwicjDQ","photo_id":"QtIkMq41cObUT-sJKjWaYA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/QtIkMq41cObUT-sJKjWaYA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8656187057495117},{"business_id":"itAhmbhHOyQQparfwicjDQ","photo_id":"6oqmPK0rVqvkhbl88jL4RA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/6oqmPK0rVqvkhbl88jL4RA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8655351400375366}]},"notebook_case":null}
